    "note": "Trang Web pulls non-legal static pages from config/site-pages.json; Pháp Lý holds the legal pages; Cẩm Nang resolves hubs > canonical categories > non-empty subtopics from data/blog/taxonomy.json; Dịch Vụ has verified contact actions. Agent chat keeps its reset control.",
